{
  "label": "cafe25",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label cafe25:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gooddayredux1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gooddayredux1.webp",
      "alt": "gooddayredux1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Another morning at the cafe means another chance to be poisoned by an overly creative and mildly intimidating barista.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But upon entering, I realize that Rin isn’t behind the counter.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "In fact, no one is behind the counter.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "No one is in the cafe at all...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What exactly is going on here?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, loser. Can’t you read?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gooddayredux2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gooddayredux2.webp",
      "alt": "gooddayredux2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What's going on? Where is everyone? Also, don't call me a loser.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'll call you whatever I want to call you, loser. And what, was the big sign on the door saying we're closed today not enough to tip you off?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why are you closed? It's just a random weekend.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Also, why are you here if you're closed? And why are you wearing your casual clothes?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Damn, Sensei. Didn't realize we were gonna be playing twenty questions today. You know you can just ask me what color my underwear is, right? You don't have to beat around the bush.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, I can?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gooddayredux3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gooddayredux3.webp",
      "alt": "gooddayredux3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. But I thought I'd be a good friend and give you some hope since I can't give you any coffee today.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What good is hope if you're just going to take it away immediately?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don't know, homie. Ask the Rin floatin' around in your fantasies later. She'll probs know better than I do.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Homie?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry. I meant to say Sensei. I mix those two words up all the time.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I feel like that would be mildly problematic if you had literally anyone else as a teacher.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I guess I'm lucky I ended up with you then, huh?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess so...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": For real, though. Why are you closed?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gooddayredux4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gooddayredux4.webp",
      "alt": "gooddayredux4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Repairs or something, I think. Wasn't really informed of the full details.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": All I know is that Haruka needed somebody to come in and tidy stuff up before the repair people came and I just happened to have some extra time on my hands this morning.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gooddayredux3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gooddayredux3.webp",
      "alt": "gooddayredux3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Lucky for you, I've got even more spare time now since I've already finished up everything that needed to be done.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you mean we're actually going to spend the morning together with you not in that funny visor?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gooddayredux5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gooddayredux5.webp",
      "alt": "gooddayredux5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Woah, there! What did my visor ever do to you? You can't just talk crap on it like that.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I blame the lack of caffeine. So, in a roundabout sort of way, it's actually your fault I said that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gooddayredux6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gooddayredux6.webp",
      "alt": "gooddayredux6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, I don't follow that logic at all. But if you want coffee, we can get some on the way. There are plenty of cafes between here and the urban district.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? We're going all the way over there?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gooddayredux2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gooddayredux2.webp",
      "alt": "gooddayredux2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hell yeah, man. I wanna walk around the city.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I haven’t been getting out much lately and I need some exercise before my limbs fall off or stop working or something.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Neither of those things happen due to lack of exercise but sure, I guess I’ll walk around with you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Neat! Well, I'm ready whenever you are.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, and the answer was black, by the way.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The answer to- oh.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gooddayredux3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gooddayredux3.webp",
      "alt": "gooddayredux3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You're welcome, homie.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gooddayredux7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gooddayredux7.webp",
      "alt": "gooddayredux7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Rin and I spend some time walking around the more...metropolitan section of Kumon-mi.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It's not one I venture too often, so I wind up sticking close to her as she leads us...well, wherever she's in the mood to lead us, I guess.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So far, that has equated to nothing but anime stores where she proceeded to freak out about the prices of things before getting upset and leaving.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This has happened five times now and I still do not have any coffee.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gooddayredux8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gooddayredux8.webp",
      "alt": "gooddayredux8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who shoved a stick up your butt, Mr. Crankypants?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Excuse me?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You've barely said anything since we left the cafe. Am I boring you, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or are you just a little embarrassed to be walking around with a moderately cute girl?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'd rank you several levels above moderate, Rin.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why, that's the nicest thing anyone has ever said to me. Thank you, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You're welcome. Can I get coffee now?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gooddayredux9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gooddayredux9.webp",
      "alt": "gooddayredux9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, crap! I totally forgot!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why didn’t you say anything sooner?!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I even dragged you into that one anime store that you were totally uninterested in!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It was five.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Five?! Why did you let me carry on for so long?!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gooddayredux10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gooddayredux10.webp",
      "alt": "gooddayredux10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You need to be more open about your needs, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If this relationship is ever going to work, we're going to have to keep each other in check.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Using the word relationship makes it sound like we're more than just friends, you know.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gooddayredux11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gooddayredux11.webp",
      "alt": "gooddayredux11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But...we are, aren't we?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Rin pauses for a moment as her face begins to redden and her eyes get locked on mine.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I know this face. She’s about to confess her-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gooddayredux12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gooddayredux12.webp",
      "alt": "gooddayredux12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Homies.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why do you keep saying that all of a sudden?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What?! You said we're just friends, but we're so much more than that! Homies are like...four steps above friends.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I guess you probs wouldn't know that since you're such a friggin' boomer.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why am I being bullied today? All I wanted was coffee.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And all I want is a cute gyaru girlfriend with fishnets and a cell phone addiction.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess we can't always get what we want, though, can we?...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gooddayredux8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gooddayredux8.webp",
      "alt": "gooddayredux8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Buuuuut...since I’m the greatest and coolest homie in the entire world, we can stop for coffee at the next cafe we see.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And I just so happen to know a pretty good place right around the corner and-",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene gooddayredux13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/gooddayredux13.webp",
      "alt": "gooddayredux13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah-!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Rin suddenly stops walking when something catches her attention.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Holy shit.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Holy shit. Holy shit. Holy shit.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? What's wrong?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We have been graced by the presence of an angel...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene omgkaori1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/omgkaori1.webp",
      "alt": "omgkaori1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Rin lunges forward toward the angel who is none other than the Queen of Spiders herself- Kaori.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I'm surprised to see this sort of reaction out of her, though.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I get that Rin is incredibly attracted to girls, but the way she's acting toward Kaori makes it seem like-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh my god! No friggin’ way! Kaori?! Is that really you?!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": H-How do you know my name?! Who are you?!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Identify yourself!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh...what’s going on here, exactly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene omgkaori2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/omgkaori2.webp",
      "alt": "omgkaori2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hamburger Man! Help! I am under attack!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene omgkaori3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/omgkaori3.webp",
      "alt": "omgkaori3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Hamburger Man?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s better to not ask.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How are you doing, Kaori?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Horrible! I require immediate assistance and will pay you in meat for the favors you will perform today!",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And what exactly do you need immediate assistance with? You’re not actually under attack.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene omgkaori4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/omgkaori4.webp",
      "alt": "omgkaori4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m...not under attack?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course not. Rin's just a mildly annoying, extraordinarily horny teenager.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's true. I really am.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Rin, would you mind explaining how you know Kaori? Because she...definitely does not seem like she knows you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Was she your waitress before or something?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
